          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "4346d28a-de70-5071-9d4a-792ed97d7a28",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 698,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.35.090:block:1",
          "start": 305
        },
        "quote": "(b) It shall be the responsibility of each day care facility to test and maintain the fire alarm system and/or smoke detectors to assure that such system is in working order. Testing of the fire alarm system and/or smoke detectors shall be on a monthly basis. A true and accurate record of the testing shall be kept and maintained and made available for inspection by the City Fire Department.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.35.090:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
