        "label": "TMC 8.35.090 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "0b1dd885-80d4-5b7b-829e-c79bfa82aed7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 975,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.35.090:block:2",
          "start": 699
        },
        "quote": "(c) For the purposes of this section, a “day care facility” shall be defined as a facility that cares for more than 10 children for more than three hours a day but less than 24 hours a day, including daytime, evening and nighttime care. (Code 1981 § 16-60. Code 1995 § 70-59.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.35.090:block:2#text",
